s/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429167#post1429167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And those points are?</div> </div> </div> </div>Watch and find out for yourself","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T10:05:58-08:00","id":1429175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429167#post1429167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And those points are?</div> </div> </div> </div>Am watching now, so will update as I get thru it<br /> <br /> * Anarch Tzimisce making zero sense, and craps on there history<br /> *Vozhd being a joke now<br /> *Tzimisce bane causing physical damage, and making no sense compared to what it used to be, and what originally caused it.<br /> <br /> *Amalgams are making things more complicated and difficult to find, not easier.<br /> <br /> v5 being a soft reboot or disregarding what came before, without any explanation, throwing out disciplines. Basically it is not a continuation of previous editions. OR rather it is, 