"signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T14:22:53-08:00","id":1429236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429224#post1429224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You sure are making a mountain out of two cherry picked paragraphs from a book that's been widely disregarded in V5, if you read the v5 anarch book you would know this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, let's say say you're right about that, why does that apply to the Companion? We've come far way from the early days of V5 and all that mess.<br /> <br /> Especially since it's worth noting who the Developer and one of the authors of Anarchs Unbound, Justin Achilli. Which means that he probably was thinking of the Anarch Tzimisce in said book when he was writing them in the Companion. As I've said before, we've gotten no indication of a shake up in the Clan like the Lasombra, leaving the only logical conclusion until we hear otherwise that the Anarch Tzimisce the Companion talks about are of the same kind as those talked about in V20AU.<br /> <br /> So again, anyone upset over Anarch Tzimisce in the Companion have to also be upset over them in V20 Anarchs Unbound because that's where the retcon first happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T14:28:45-08:00","id":1429238,"title":"","content":"I don't find the idea of Tzimisce in the Anarchs that hard to swallow, at least as far as previous editions are concerned<br /> <br /> with the new V5 bane and compulsion though...they don't seem the kind of guys the Anarchs would be comfortable having around","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T14:45:11-08:00","id":1429240,"title":"","content":"The Anarchs don't have a set character or a general set focus besides taking out the &quot;Elders&quot; (which has been achieved with V5's unsavory &quot;Beckoning&quot; metaplot and contrivance to get all the Elders out the game such the new mechanics can't support them. Also nevermind the fact that the Anarchs also have Elders in their sect too.. so..). They're just whatever in terms of anything (i.e Chaotic Neutral). That's why their namesake has the prefix denoting to Anarchy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T15:01:13-08:00","id":1429242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429236#post1429236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay, let's say say you're right about that, why does that apply to the Companion? We've come far way from the early days of V5 and all that mess.<br /> <br /> Especially since it's worth noting who the Developer and one of the authors of Anarchs Unbound, Justin Achilli. Which means that he probably was thinking of the Anarch Tzimisce in said book when he was writing them in the Companion. As I've said before, we've gotten no indication of a shake up in the Clan like the Lasombra, leaving the only logical conclusion until we hear otherwise that the Anarch Tzimisce the Companion talks about are of the same kind as those talked about in V20AU.<br /> <br /> So again, anyone upset over Anarch Tzimisce in the Companion have to also be upset over them in V20 Anarchs Unbound because that's where the retcon first happened.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Never read Anarchs Unbound, so that is on me, but I just don't like anarchs <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T15:08:18-08:00","id":1429245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429240#post1429240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Anarchs don't have a set character or a general set focus besides taking out the &quot;Elders&quot; (which has been achieved with V5's unsavory &quot;Beckoning&quot; metaplot and contrivance to get all the Elders out the game such the new mechanics can't support them. Also nevermind the fact that the Anarchs also have Elders in their sect too.. so..). They're just whatever in terms of anything (i.e Chaotic Neutral). That's why their namesake has the prefix denoting to Anarchy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your argument is pretty strange because in real life, we have plenty of people who have fought wars both at the national (government) and street level (crime) over resources. Vampires do not like to share land, vessels, money, or authority so they fight over it. This is such a basic motivation, I don't understand how you can mock the Anarch &quot;cause&quot; because it is the primal one of, &quot;I don't want to be a slave to 1000 year old monsters who don't want competition.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mind you, I feel that a large part of the Anarchs appeal depends to how inversely benevolent you view the Camarilla to be. I view it as a bunch of people who will kick you in the nuts and make you lick your boots at Elysium just because.<br /> <br /> If you think of them as the good guys who give you an open shot to join the Illuminati, obviously your opinion will be different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-20-2020, 08:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T15:49:48-08:00","id":1429254,"title":"","content":"Also Anarchs have a lot of political ideologies, some of which at least partially hearken back to the real world version of anarchy, which is &quot;eliminating hierarchies.&quot; Not sheer violent lawlessness, not &quot;chaotic neutral&quot; (alignments are bad here at any rate), but a society in which no one is subjugated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T16:17:48-08:00","id":1429262,"title":"","content":"I am of the mind that this thread is getting out