e\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429263#post1429263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> the moderator has already issued a warning on page 17,<br /> we'll be fine...probably</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but the expression of a desire for violence has me concerned.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T16:49:59-08:00","id":1429266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429238#post1429238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">with the new V5 bane and compulsion though...they don't seem the kind of guys the Anarchs would be comfortable having around</div> </div> </div> </div>The Anarchs are everything that is not Camarilla - the Tzimisce (not in the Sabbat) will become Anarch if for no other reasons than almost none of them will be joining the Camarilla.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T16:56:29-08:00","id":1429268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429254#post1429254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also Anarchs have a lot of political ideologies, some of which at least partially hearken back to the real world version of anarchy, which is &quot;eliminating hierarchies.&quot; Not sheer violent lawlessness, not &quot;chaotic neutral&quot; (alignments are bad here at any rate), but a society in which no one is subjugated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, you'd be surprised at the number of people that think the Anarchs are nothing more than a bunch of punks and thugs scream 'FREEDOM!!!' all the time. I remember one game I played in years ago with a guy who claimed that while he had never played VtM before, he had read a bunch of the game books and played VtMB. Yet got completely surprised and befuddled when presented with a group of Anarch intellectuals, dressed in suits, well-spoken and intelligent. Which in turn prompted him to exclaim 'But they're not punks!' and us explaining to him that are many kinds of Anarchs, not all are punks. Which led to an argument and him revealing that he had only played VtMB and read the Rulebook. When we pointed out that both Issac and Therese were Anarchs they tried to argue that they weren't, that they couldn't be, declaring something to the effect of them being too 'smart' to be Anarchs.<br /> <br /> It wasn't until the ST showed him the Socialists of Chicago by Night 1E, the inspiration for the coterie he had created that he finally started to accept that there could be more to Anarchs than Nines and his gang.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T17:11:38-08:00","id":1429269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429266#post1429266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Anarchs are everything that is not Camarilla - the Tzimisce (not in the Sabbat) will become Anarch if for no other reasons than almost none of them will be joining the Camarilla.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So then why the hell did the Lasombra join the Camarilla and not the Anarchs?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T17:30:45-08:00","id":1429272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429268#post1429268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, you'd be surprised at the number of people that think the Anarchs are nothing more than a bunch of punks and thugs scream 'FREEDOM!!!' all the time. I remember one game I played in years ago with a guy who claimed that while he had never played VtM before, he had read a bunch of the game books and played VtMB. Yet got completely surprised and befuddled when presented with a group of Anarch intellectuals, dressed in suits, well-spoken and intelligent. Which in turn prompted him to exclaim 'But they're not punks!' and us explaining to him that are many kinds of Anarchs, not all are punks. Which led to an argument and him revealing that he had only played VtMB and read the Rulebook. When we pointed out that both Issac and Therese were Anarchs they tried to argue that they weren't, that they couldn't be, declaring something to the effect of them being too 'smart' to be Anarchs.<br /> <br /> It wasn't until the ST showed him the Socialists of Chicago by Night 1E, the inspiration for the coterie he had created that he finally started to accept that there could be more to Anarchs than Nines and his gang.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's just so weird and frustrating because people have such a weird idea of what &quot;anarchy&quot; means as a political system.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T17:43:31-08:00","id":1429273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429269#post1429269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> So then why the hell did the Lasombra join the Camarilla and not the Anarchs?</div> </div> </div> </div>Better dental plan *rimshot* I don't want to spoil the reason because it's in CbN but imo it's dumb and highly convoluted","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T17:51:47-08:00","id":1429274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429269#post1429269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So then why the hell did the Lasombra join the Camarilla and not the Anarchs?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the argument is that the Lasombra joined the Camarilla for the fact that they don't actually give a shit about the Sabbat as a political ideology, it was just their particular feeding trough and cult. When the Sabbat got way too focused on ACTUALLY FIGHTING THE ANTEDILUVIANS (and the Antediluvians proved to be real), the Lasombra noped the fuck out. They joined the Camarilla because the Ventrue had lost the Brujah and Gangrel while the Tremere were weakened tremendously.<br /> <br /> It was the perfect time for the Lasombra to make a play to takeover the Camarilla itself for themselves. Which they have a very good chance of doing.<br /> <br /> Besides, Marcus Vitel IS an Anarch and controls Washington D.C.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429273#post1429273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Better dental plan *rimshot* I don't want to spoil the reason because it's in CbN but imo it's dumb and highly convoluted</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really that convoluted.<br /> <br /> The Lasombra realized their Antediluvian was alive and decided they needed to pretend they hadn't acted like that classic Transformer meme.<br /> <br /> &quot;Megatron has gone to the bathroom! Now I, Starscream, am leader of the Decepticons!&quot;<br /> <br /> They also lost control of the Antitribu and other shovelheads, who wanted to go fight the Antediluvians NOW and ended up becoming possessed by ancient souls and the Beast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-20-2020, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T18:13:16-08:00","id":1429276,"title":"","content":"If anything, the Anarchs would better fit the Lasombra, not the Camarilla. Not only is it heeded by they're rivals by millennia even before the formation of the Sects, there is no possible way they will advance in the Camarilla being in the lowest possible totem pole. They already lost so much status from their main project and basically their de-facto Sect along with the Tzimisce losing so much ground and relevance, its not even funny. The main fact that that conversely the Lasombra have seen themselves so unrealiable and incompetent to lose so much of their clan into the Camarilla would doubly ensure they've lost status in the Sabbat too.<br /> <br /> The Lasombra have always known (and the rest of the Sabbat) that the Antediluvian were always more or less real and some them still active. FFS their clan got so much acclaim because they destroyed their Antediluvian (atleast they thought they did apparently). The Anarchs would exemplify the Lasombra's clan culture and themes of picking up your own bootstraps and general loose conglomeration, but working tightly and competently together if need be... but they wimp and go to the Camarilla that they spent so much resources, manpower, and unlife fighting?<br /> <br /> Its one of the most idiotic metaplot changes in V5. To even have this incompetent version of the Lasombra in V5 somehow do an asspull and &quot;takeover the Camarilla&quot; from the inside would be laughable; its even funny to even think the Venture would even allow them in the first place and just bar their potential and obvious rivals in their de-facto Sect.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also if the logic of the Lasombra is leaving the Sabbat because they fear their Antediluvian, why go to the Camarilla and not the Anarchs again? Because only the Sabbat is actively against the Antediluvians; when has the Anarchs been really against them, as their main malignment is toward the contemporary &quot;Elders&quot; of Vampire society, not the Antediluvians. It still doesn't make sense for them to go to the Camarilla, just nonsense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 12-20-2020, 09:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T18:39:25-08:00","id":1429277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429276#post1429276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anything, the Anarchs would better fit the Lasombra, not the Camarilla. Not only is it heeded by they're rivals by millennia even before the formation of the Sects, there is no possible way they will advance in the Camarilla being in the lowest possible totem pole.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's silly.<br /> <br /> The Ventrue NEED the Lasombra, the Lasombra don't need the Ventrue.<br /> <br /> Besides, the Lasombra have an ally with no previous ties to the Ventrue or Tremere power structure in the Banu Haqim.<br /> <br /> What, exactly is the Ventrue going to say to the Lasombra propping up their failing experiment with their money and influence.<br /> <br /> &quot;No?&quot;<br /> <br /> To dictate terms, you have to have power over your subject and the Lasombra are every bit as powerful as the Ventrue.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> FFS their clan got so much acclaim because they destroyed their Antediluvian (atleast they thought they did apparently). </div> </div> </div>Exactly.<br /> <br /> I was utterly skeptical of any argument the Lasombra would join the Cammies except for this one.<br /> <br /> The Lasombra missed. They failed to take down their Antediluvian. As such, the Sabbat became a bunch of losers to be ditched.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T18:59:52-08:00","id":1429278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Ventrue NEED the Lasombra, the Lasombra don't need the Ventrue.</div> </div> </div> </div>What are you even talking about? The Venture don't NEED the Lasombra when their former sect that they more or less made has completely failed this edition (by writer's fiat of course). The Lasombra LITERALLY have no power in the Camarilla (but assuredly through pure writer fiat, they'll asspull a reason for the Lasombra to gain a powerbase in the Camarilla when the smartest thing the Venture should've done was completely bar them all from joining the Camarilla in the first place) at all. They are basically runts now. They don't have as or is a &quot;bit of powerful&quot; as the Venture at this moment. The Venture have humiliated and won over the Lasombra and they're nothing more than edgy peons now. &quot;No.&quot; Is what exactly the Venture CAN do because the Lasombra are begging puppies on their doorstep now with V5s metaplot. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Besides, the Lasombra have an ally with no previous ties to the Ventrue or Tremere power structure in the Banu Haqim.</div> </div> </div> </div>What? Since when has the Lasombra and Banu Haqim been allies? What do you mean here? The Lasombra if anything else and atleast tenuously have been alleged with the Tzimisce all this time. I never heard a single time they were allies with the Banu Haqim at all.<br /> <br /> Seriously, if the writers are going to break up the setting to their personal liking and take out the stuff they don't like, atleast make it make sense. For the Lasombra to leave the Sabbat (by writer's fiat of course), but not join the Anarchs but the Camarilla... is absurdly dumb.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T19:08:42-08:00","id":1429279,"title":"","content":"Turns out the post-Week of Nightmares Ravnos Antitribu were right about the Lasombra I guess<br /> <br /> accidentally right, because their logic didn't quite work but can you blame them, really?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2367,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","user":"Resplendent Fire","date":". 12-21-2020, 12:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T19:48:33-08:00","id":1429283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429278#post1429278\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What are you even talking about? The Venture don't NEED the Lasombra when their former sect that they more or less made has completely failed this edition (by writer's fiat of course). The Lasombra LITERALLY have no power in the Camarilla (but assuredly through pure writer fiat, they'll asspull a reason for the Lasombra to gain a powerbase in the Camarilla when the smartest thing the Venture should've done was completely bar them all from joining the Camarilla in the first place) at all. They are basically runts now. They don't have as or is a &quot;bit of powerful&quot; as the Venture at this moment. The Venture have humiliated and won over the Lasombra and they're nothing more than edgy peons now. &quot;No.&quot; Is what exactly the Venture CAN do because the Lasombra are begging puppies on their doorstep now with V5s metaplot.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't even get this argument. The Ventrue don't have the Brujah or the Gangrel, that is TWO CLANS OUT OF SEVEN leaving, which is 30% of the Camarilla. The Lasombra have vast wealth, power, and influence on religious institutions. The Ventrue are hammered by the Beckoning, Second Inquisition, and the Anarch resurgance. So they need a new clan to join. The Tremere are at their weakest since the Omen War.<br /> <br /> The Ventrue letting the Lasombra join is the only way they can stabilize their rule.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T20:13:14-08:00","id":1429285,"title":"","content":"If the Venture is facing all that, why did the Lasombra flock to the Camarilla and not the Anarchs to finally take out their rivals riding on the &quot;Anarch resurgance&quot;? If the Lasombra went to THEM as hapless orphans, it seems to me the Camarilla (and essentially the Venture) isn't doing all that bad compared to the failure the Sabbat is facing that was the Lasombra's whole project for centuries. Again, the Venture don't need the Lasombra, the latter came crawling to them.<br /> <br /> If the Lasombra were more confident and weren't incompetent and felt the need to cut loose from the Sabbat, they should've subsumed themselves into the Anarchs.. but to go into the Camarilla that is helmed by their main rival? Even then if you say the Venture is reeling from all the problems you say in your, why the flip should they induct the Lasombra where its obvious they will try and subvert their Sect from under them, despite the minutiae &quot;benefits&quot; the Lasombra might bring to them (nevermind the fact that the Lasombra are much more individualistic than the Venture and don't pool their resources into the clan itself unlike the Venture does, so the argument that the Venture need their &quot;wealth, power, and influence&quot; is moot and religious influence is nowhere near as important at all in the modern age; atleast Catholicism to be exact)? Everything the Lasombra have the Venture already have, so why the hell does it make sense for the Venture to bring them in? It makes no sense at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T20:36:23-08:00","id":1429289,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429285#post1429285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If the Venture is facing all that, why did the Lasombra flock to the Camarilla and not the Anarchs to finally take out their rivals riding on the &quot;Anarch resurgance&quot;? If the Lasombra went to THEM as hapless orphans, it seems to me the Camarilla (and essentially the Venture) isn't doing all that bad compared to the failure the Sabbat is facing that was the Lasombra's whole project for centuries. Again, the Venture don't need the Lasombra, the latter came crawling to them.<br /> <br /> If the Lasombra were more confident and weren't incompetent and felt the need to cut loose from the Sabbat, they should've subsumed themselves into the Anarchs.. but to go into the Camarilla that is helmed by their main rival? Even then if you say the Venture is reeling from all the problems you say in your, why the flip should they induct the Lasombra where its obvious they will try and subvert their Sect from under them, despite the minutiae &quot;benefits&quot; the Lasombra might bring to them (nevermind the fact that the Lasombra are much more individualistic than the Venture and don't pool their resources into the clan itself unlike the Venture does, so the argument that the Venture need their &quot;wealth, power, and influence&quot; is moot and religious influence is nowhere near as important at all in the modern age; atleast Catholicism to be exact)? Everything the Lasombra have the Venture already have, so why the hell does it make sense for the Venture to bring them in? It makes no sense at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t see Lasombra as individualistic in a liberal 'live and let live\u2019 sense, but in a Darwinian, sociopathic sense. They are in it for themselves - but they seek to gain power through manipulation and intrigue via establishments and institutions. The Camarilla is still much more institutionalised than the Anarchs will ever be, so it gives them a better medium towards power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T21:17:18-08:00","id":1429293,"title":"","content":"Lasombra &gt; Brujah in the Camarilla because the physical prowess plus a love of authoritarianism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T22:07:27-08:00","id":1429294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429285#post1429285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If the Venture is facing all that, why did the Lasombra flock to the Camarilla and not the Anarchs to finally take out their rivals riding on the &quot;Anarch resurgance&quot;? If the Lasombra went to THEM as hapless orphans, it seems to me the Camarilla (and essentially the Venture) isn't doing all that bad compared to the failure the Sabbat is facing that was the Lasombra's whole project for centuries. Again, the Venture don't need the Lasombra, the latter came crawling to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because the Anarchs don't have a vast network of vast wealth and are actively resistant to control? The Anarchs are impossible to control and can't be made into a controllable sect.<br /> <br /> The Camarilla....is not.<br /> <br /> I mean, the Sabbat is a failed experiment, why would they want to make Sabbat 2.0 with the Anarchs?<br /> <br /> I mean, the Lasombra want control and power. They cannot get that with a disorganized band that is fiercely individualistic and ready to die for their freedom. Even when they'd be better off serving. They just got out of that herd of cats.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T22:11:53-08:00","id":1429296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429272#post1429272\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, it's just so weird and frustrating because people have such a weird idea of what &quot;anarchy&quot; means as a political system.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly they weren't the worst person I've encountered with those notions. I once encountered a ST that was so entrenched with his notions of what the Clans are like and who they Embraced that you could not deviate from that or else you weren't playing the game right. Want to play an intellectual Gangrel that would rather talk things out than fight? No! Gangrels can only be survivalists, animal lovers or loner bad asses! Want to play an Indian Ravnos that doesn't have much interest in wandering or crime? Wrong! Ravnos are only nomadic thieving Gypsies!<br /> <br /> Even years later I still get so very frustrated when I see people act like that, that Kindred of Clan X can only be X or that the Ravnos can only be Roma.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429289#post1429289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don\u2019t see Lasombra as individualistic in a liberal 'live and let live\u2019 sense, but in a Darwinian, sociopathic sense. They are in it for themselves - but they seek to gain power through manipulation and intrigue via establishments and institutions. The Camarilla is still much more institutionalised than the Anarchs will ever be, so it gives them a better medium towards power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly this as lets not forget that the core of the defectors were the elders and leaders of the Clan, the kind of vampires that would actually like the structures of the Cam as by their age, power and Generation would afford them positions of authority within the Sect. They don't have to pretend that they're all 'equal'. They are the heads of the Clan therefore they are in charge. Well, at least as much as the Cam will currently let them. So yeah why join the other Sect that declares everyone's equal when you can join the Sect that merely pays that lip service and keeps all the power in the hands of elders like yourself?<br /> <br /> Because surprise surprise, vampires are hypocrites regardless of their Clan or Sect.<br /> <br /> Let's face it, the V5 Lasombra are just the Lasombra Antitribu of previous editions bulked up in numbers and presence. Though by their own admission, they're less than half the actual Clan that was in the Sabbat. So technically they should still be classified as Antitribu.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T22:21:31-08:00","id":1429297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429296#post1429296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's face it, the V5 Lasombra are just the Lasombra Antitribu of previous editions bulked up in numbers and presence. Though by their own admission, they're less than half the actual Clan that was in the Sabbat. So technically they should still be classified as Antitribu.</div> </div> </div> </div>Antribu don't really make much sense anymore since all of the vampire clans have membership in all of the sects now.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T22:28:04-08:00","id":1429298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429297#post1429297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Antribu don't really make much sense anymore since all of the vampire clans have membership in all of the sects now.</div> </div> </div> </div>True. Well, aside from the Hecata right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T22:50:24-08:00","id":1429299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because the Anarchs don't have a vast network of vast wealth and are actively resistant to control?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even when they'd be better off serving.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's the EXACT thing the Lasombra could've brought to the Anarchs; wealth. Didn't you just say &quot;The Lasombra have vast wealth, power, and influence on religious institutions&quot;? And &quot;serving&quot; is NOT how the Lasombra operate, but this is how they are relegated to with V5s metaplot universe. None of it makes sense. And also aren't the Lasombra masters of manipulation apparently? With their supposed &quot;ultra-competence&quot; of playing people or things like a fiddle, why couldn't they join the Anarchs and commit a &quot;soft-power&quot; control over the sect; y'know, like all the de-facto Anarch leaders have been doing for centuries? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exactly this as lets not forget that the core of the defectors were the elders and leaders of the Clan, the kind of vampires that would actually like the structures of the Cam as by their age, power and Generation would afford them positions of authority within the Sect.</div> </div> </div> </div>What elders and leaders? Literally ALL of them have been shuttled to the Middle-East with the V5 Beckoning. Real Lasombra leadership and directive would've never had the clan be in this despicable rut, especially pawning to the Venture and begging to be in the Sect they've literally spent their entire unlives fighting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T23:03:57-08:00","id":1429300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429266#post1429266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Anarchs are everything that is not Camarilla - the Tzimisce (not in the Sabbat) will become Anarch if for no other reasons than almost none of them will be joining the Camarilla.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hang on, Anarchs are a sect, with a structure, leaders etc, why is that an auto join?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T00:22:07-08:00","id":1429306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429134#post1429134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would. Because it IS a new game in the same way that D&amp;D 5e is a new game compared to 4E, 3e and AD&amp;D. The mechanics ARE different. That's inarguable.<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>I just meant calling it a new game can get you pinged for edition warring.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T02:20:49-08:00","id":1429314,"title":"","content":"My first impressions of the Companion: as a Tzimisce lover I'm happy to see my favorite Clan coming back to being playable options in fifth edition. I feel like there was a lot more to them than this book's iteration of Tzimisce, but I like the lore and what they did with them in V5.<br /> <br /> I have mixed feelings about Vicissitude. I feel like it was mostly an extremely harsh nerf, the penalties for using Vicissitude now are incredibly punishing and incredibly restricting, to the point where I just don't want to use it as a player. The <i>Weapons</i> use of Vicissitude, for example, is basically just Feral Weapons except worse in every way, shape and form and also costs you a literal arm and a leg. <br /> I think that representing Vicissitude alterations through Merits (the points to which you get from the roll successes) would have been much more preferable, for the most part.<br /> <br /> Reducing your Attribute points is horrendous. With Experience costs sky-high, people are forced to min-max and specialize. A Vampire character in V5 isn't likely to see many Attribute increases. <br /> <br /> Furthermore, this cost makes no sense considering the devs then ALSO limit the number of alterations and even go so far as to limit the Weapons alteration to Single change per subject. Why limit and punish the player further? <br /> <br /> Also, Tzimisce can't harvest other people's bodies for &quot;materials&quot;?<br /> I don't see why Vicissitude needed to be the Discipline to get smacked with nerf-sticks while Dominate and Presence are things that exist, and are pretty much mental Vicissitude...<br /> <br /> I also don't like that Fleshcrafting is a Dominate Amalgem. Feels very restricting. What if I wanted my Tzimisce to build towards Animalism, instead?<br /> Very limiting.<br /> <br /> But, I haven't played V5 yet, so I can't judge it yet.<br /> I'm very excited to play Tzimisce if I do get a chance to play. Maybe one day we'll be able to play Sabbat again, as well. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T02:26:20-08:00","id":1429316,"title":"","content":"It goes like this: <br /> <br /> The Lasombra are assholes who've been reading too much Ayn Rand despite being feverently religious. They're even more &quot;Republican Party&quot; than the Ventrue. <br /> While, logically, the Lasombra should defect to the Anarchs or make their own sect, thematically, they absolutely have to join the Camarilla to fit with the worldview that dominates V5; The Anarchs are the liberals, the Camarilla are conservative. The Ministry are the liberals, the Church are the conservatives. Everybody needs to either be a radical or reactionary, which is why 90% of the Followers of Set have apparently chosen to gravitate towards two fringe extremes that they should've found heretical. The Tzmisce will join either the Anarchs or the Camarilla depending on whether or not the author likes them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T02:48:54-08:00","id":1429319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429316#post1429316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It goes like this:<br /> <br /> The Lasombra are assholes who've been reading too much Ayn Rand despite being feverently religious. They're even more &quot;Republican Party&quot; than the Ventrue.<br /> While, logically, the Lasombra should defect to the Anarchs or make their own sect, thematically, they absolutely have to join the Camarilla to fit with the worldview that dominates V5; The Anarchs are the liberals, the Camarilla are conservative. The Ministry are the liberals, the Church are the conservatives. Everybody needs to either be a radical or reactionary, which is why 90% of the Followers of Set have apparently chosen to gravitate towards two fringe extremes that they should've found heretical.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you misrepresent V5s worldview here. I\u00b4d argue its not as black and white as you make it look. The Ventrue are a good example for that since they are more or less the same in Cam and in Anarch. Big difference is (as the free Ventrue section in the Anarch book states) that the so called free Ventrue dont wait for an older one to die to get a shot. With their 'unchained capitalist' kind of attitude they are as much &quot;Republican Party&quot; as the Cam Ventrue.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429316#post1429316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Tzmisce will join either the Anarchs or the Camarilla depending on whether or not the author likes them.</div> </div> </div> </div>For the love of god would you please stop this kind of reasoning? Most of the time I realy enjoy your posts as they are pretty much the opposite of my opinions, so they give me a new persepctive on VtM. And most of the time your arguments hold water. But then there\u00b4s this. Just because the authors of V5 have a different look at VtM than you have, they dont &quot;like or dislike&quot; Tzimisce, the Sabbat or anything. Its not like Anchilli is sitting in a big DR. No type of armchair an plots about how he can screw us over this time. So as long as you can prove (and I dont mean a 'just look at it, he clearly has to hate them' type of proof) please stop those kinds of arguments.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T02:54:40-08:00","id":1429320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429300#post1429300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hang on, Anarchs are a sect, with a structure, leaders etc, why is that an auto join?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think what they are refering to is the notion of especially the Cam book that the Cam views everything not them (or their Partners) as Anarch. So as long as you are not the Sabbat (which in their eyes is all but gone), the Cam or the Ashira, you are Anarch per default.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T03:20:41-08:00","id":1429324,"title":"","content":"Paraphrasing and all but I got into an argument with a dev about the Hecata, and in his view he thinks it's his responsibility to make unpopular clans more &quot;popular&quot;. We apparently live in a world where fans should have factions catered to their real world ideals. That's how V5 works. It's the meta-reasoning for why there's now a different type of Tremere for every real-life viewpoint you can have, when the Pyramid used to be a monopolistic monolith. So if we take this and extrapolate, we'll probably have Tzmisce in three kinds: Hoary old elders for the Camarilla, progressives for the anarchs using body mods and changing their outward sexes, and maybe some horror shows on the side in whatever the sabbat devolved into. <br /> <br /> In my opinion, this is bad, and some clans were meant to be unliked; The Tremere were meant to be odious, that was their whole deal,everyone hates the Tremere. It was as part of their identity as ugliness is for the Nosferatu. The clan of death fucked corpses and that was just the tip of the iceberg for their creepy shit. Now, sure, I can think of some pretty compelling in-universe reasons for the Tremere split, but the Followers of Set split is utterly asinine; It should be pretty self-evident that V5 works on a paradigm of -everything is structured in accordance to someone's out-of-universe beliefs rather than some in-universe logic. Ultimately, we get the impression that most changes aren't -I like this, let's have it develop- but rather -I want to like this, but I don't, so I'll change it-","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T05:37:23-08:00","id":1429336,"title":"","content":"LIke I said, they can't rule the Anarchs because the Anarchs cannot be ruled but the Ventrue aren't powerful enough to stop them building a power base in the Camarilla. The Ventrue also need someone who can help them against the Second Inquisition and also to help fight the Anarchs and Blood Cults.<br /> <br /> That's my take on the subject.<br /> <br /> Agree or disagree.<br /> <br /> Obviouly, at your table it might make more or no sense at all. Everyone's table is differwnt.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T05:38:23-08:00","id":1429337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429324#post1429324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In my opinion, this is bad, and some clans were meant to be unliked; The Tremere were meant to be odious, that was their whole deal,everyone hates the Tremere.</div> </div> </div> </div>what are you talking about?<br /> the Tremere are the most popular clan (or were, before v5)<br /> <br /> two or three years ago, two out of three topics in this forum were about Tremere and thaumaturgy<br /> <br /> I went to some VtM discords with clan roles, and 90% of people there had the Tremere role<br /> <br /> Tremere hated? the fuck you talking about?<br /> <br /> if anything, the whole reason they re-made the Tremere was to make them &quot;less&quot; popular, because other clans were completely overlooked","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T05:54:15-08:00","id":1429340,"title":"","content":"In a first-past-the-post system, the tremere probably would end up the 'favourite clan', but FPTP routinely gives Britain the Conservative party, who most britons loath. So many people loath the greyfaces, and a good chunk of those threads were complaining about them<br /> <br /> The Trmere also get a lot of points for Love-to-hate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T05:56:40-08:00","id":1429341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429324#post1429324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Paraphrasing and all but I got into an argument with a dev about the Hecata, and in his view he thinks it's his responsibility to make unpopular clans more &quot;popular&quot;. We apparently live in a world where fans should have factions catered to their real world ideals. That's how V5 works. It's the meta-reasoning for why there's now a different type of Tremere for every real-life viewpoint you can have, when the Pyramid used to be a monopolistic monolith. So if we take this and extrapolate, we'll probably have Tzmisce in three kinds: Hoary old elders for the Camarilla, progressives for the anarchs using body mods and changing their outward sexes, and maybe some horror shows on the side in whatever the sabbat devolved into.<br /> <br /> In my opinion, this is bad, and some clans were meant to be unliked; The Tremere were meant to be odious, that was their whole deal,everyone hates the Tremere. It was as part of their identity as ugliness is for the Nosferatu. The clan of death fucked corpses and that was just the tip of the iceberg for their creepy shit. Now, sure, I can think of some pretty compelling in-universe reasons for the Tremere split, but the Followers of Set split is utterly asinine; It should be pretty self-evident that V5 works on a paradigm of -everything is structured in accordance to someone's out-of-universe beliefs rather than some in-universe logic. Ultimately, we get the impression that most changes aren't -I like this, let's have it develop- but rather -I want to like this, but I don't, so I'll change it-</div> </div> </div> </div>I saw that argument with the dev. His argument was that as a developer and from a marketing perspective it just makes sense to make everything as popular as possible and... that kind of makes sense. Still I would not say you can extract the political Ideals from the V5 books. Its not like they say: &quot;look at those filthy [insert Clan here]&quot; but they try to make the best version of every Clan (in their eyes).<br /> <br /> For the &quot;Clans being hated&quot; part. You are partially right. In an ingame sense, Ventrue 'should be' hated by other Clans (I mean... look at those fuckers). But on a Metaperspektive, you want your Players to like the Clans. Tremere would be a 'love being hated'. Ultimately YOU get the impression the changes are like that. I watched some of the interviews and either Justin Anchilli does develop stuff he likes or hes a pretty amazing liar...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T05:59:01-08:00","id":1429342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429337#post1429337\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> what are you talking about?<br /> the Tremere are the most popular clan (or were, before v5)<br /> <br /> two or three years ago, two out of three topics in this forum were about Tremere and thaumaturgy<br /> <br /> I went to some VtM discords with clan roles, and 90% of people there had the Tremere role<br /> <br /> Tremere hated? the fuck you talking about?<br /> <br /> if anything, the whole reason they re-made the Tremere was to make them &quot;less&quot; popular, because other clans were completely overlooked</div> </div> </div> </div>That they were popular doesn't mean that they were likeable. Not the same thing.<br /> <br /> Some villans people loves to hate. Albeit I would think Tremere popularity wasn't so much for any roleplaying/story reason, but merely because Thaumaturgy was popular and all the other options to get it were outliers, needing ST special aproval. But even if that was not the case, I would need hard proof to believe they were popular because they were likeable","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 12-21-2020, 09:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T06:01:38-08:00","id":1429344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429342#post1429342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And as nitpick: topic frequency proves 0. Stuff loads of people hates get's a topic. Stuff that's confusing it's bound to get topics. There aren't that many topics about expressing how much you like something...</div> </div> </div> </div>they did a clan popularity survey for v5,<br /> Tremere came out on top, followed by malkavian<br /> I think Lasombra was third, but they were far less popular than the first two<br /> <br /> and the Tremere &quot;are&quot; likeable, they're the most likeable in fact,<br /> <br /> whenI ask people why they chose Tremere over any other clan or any other blood mage,<br /> they usually respond that Tremere started from nothing and managed to own everyone else,<br /> they are a clan that works and had to work for what they get rather than a clan who inherited their tallent from bloodlines and antideluvians<br /> <br /> that's what makes them likeable to most players","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 12-21-2020, 09:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T06:10:04-08:00","id":1429348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429233#post1429233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have this urge to find you and punch you.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">And you're out of this thread.<br /> <br /> Also, take an infraction as a warning. No threats of violence ever are tolerated here. Also, and it bears mentioning, it's just a game.</span><br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25794_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25794\" data-vbnamecard=\"25794\">MyWifeIsScary</a> is allowed back in the thread because we discussed the issue via PM. Don't threaten violence even jokingly. It doesn't help the forum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-21-2020, 10:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T06:28:48-08:00","id":1429351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429300#post1429300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hang on, Anarchs are a sect, with a structure, leaders etc, why is that an auto join?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Anarchs are not really a sect, at least not in the sense the Camarilla is and the Sabbat were a sect. The Anarchs are just a mass of vampires, and a collection of groups (so they have a lot of leaders and structures), and are generally defined as everyone and everything vampiric that is not Camarilla, (or I suppose Sabbat or Hecata). And the term Anarch seems to be used more by the Camarilla than by the Anarchs themselves. There is no singular structure or rule or leader to oppose Tzimisce become Anarchs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T06:51:53-08:00","id":1429352,"title":"","content":"In order to be an anarch, per the treaty you have to go before the local prince, state your grievances and declare yourself such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T07:14:17-08:00","id":1429355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429352#post1429352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In order to be an anarch, per the treaty you have to go before the local prince, state your grievances and declare yourself such.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is, of course, something most Anarchs won't bother with.<br /> <br /> It's also a pejoratiove that the Camarilla applies to non-Camarilla vampires.<br /> <br /> The irony being it DOESNT apply to the Sabbat despite the fact the Sabbat are the OG Anarchs and pretty much 90% still follow their philosophy, such as it exists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T07:46:17-08:00","id":1429359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429299#post1429299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What elders and leaders? Literally ALL of them have been shuttled to the Middle-East with the V5 Beckoning. Real Lasombra leadership and directive would've never had the clan be in this despicable rut, especially pawning to the Venture and begging to be in the Sect they've literally spent their entire unlives fighting.</div> </div> </div> </div>TheAmici Noctis, the secret group that's been directing the Clan for ages. They're the ones that looked at what was going on and decided to see if they could jump ship, leading to the situation we now have. And they actually did in the beginning reach out to both the Cam and the Anarchs. We don't know what exactly happened with the Anarch meetings but it sounds like the Cam was their preferred choice.<br /> <br /> In the very next section to the where it talks about them reaching out the Cam and striking the deal they did, we have a Lasombra outright admitting that their Clan is 'a clan of hypocrisy and pragmatism' which they don't actually treat as a bad thing, going on to talk about how while many Lasombra use the Catholic Church, few do so for any spiritual reason but rather for power. While it isn't said, given the material talked about just before has other Keepers talking about how they threw their Clan mates and fellow Sabbat under the bus to get themselves in with the Camarilla, the same can be said for these Lasombra and Sect politics.<br /> <br /> That's the thing, we're not talking about all the Sabbat Lasombra here, the True Believers of the Sabbat, we're talking about the ones that are... well hypocrites that don't care about the Sabbat (or really any Sect) beyond what it can do for them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T07:48:32-08:00","id":1429360,"title":"","content":"My view on the subject is that the Lasombra have always been somewhat hamstrung by the fact that they are a heavily intrigue and political backstabbing laden clan but there's very little opportunity for them to do that in a Blood Bound and religious fanatic-filled sect.<br /> <br /> We always needed MOAR Lasombra Antitribu.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T08:00:50-08:00","id":1429361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429360#post1429360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My view on the subject is that the Lasombra have always been somewhat hamstrung by the fact that they are a heavily intrigue and political backstabbing laden clan but there's very little opportunity for them to do that in a Blood Bound and religious fanatic-filled sect.</div> </div> </div> </div>wrong, the Sabbat had the most opportunity for intrigue and political backstabbing,<br /> so much so that both devs and players thought that they got too much of it, when they shouldn't have so much of it (for whatever reason),<br /> and have gotten rid of it to let the Camarilla claim back the monopoly on intrigue and politicking","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T08:11:09-08:00","id":1429362,"title":"","content":"I really, really like Lasombra antitribu. <br /> But V5 has screwed them over totally, the ones already in the cam are fucked, the ones joining are fucking themselves. How do they break the Vauldrie? How do they... It's just an objectively bad deal. There's a ripe, easy option with the Anarchs. Give em some time and they could probably make a new sect or otherwise reform the anarchs to something of their liking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T08:13:05-08:00","id":1429363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429355#post1429355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which is, of course, something most Anarchs won't bother with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is great because an idle Scourge is good for nobody. Want to live under the treaties protection you have to do the bare minimum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T08:53:32-08:00","id":1429368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429363#post1429363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which is great because an idle Scourge is good for nobody. Want to live under the treaties protection you have to do the bare minimum.</div> </div> </div> </div>And then the Scourge gets murdered.<br /> <br /> And then there's more crackdowns.<br /> <br /> And then there's the investigations that go nowhere.<br /> <br /> And that's Tuesday in the Camarilla.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428599-v5-vampire-companion?p=1429362#post1429362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really, really like Lasombra antitribu.<br /> But V5 has screwed them over totally, the ones already in the cam are fucked, the ones joining are fucking themselves. How do they break the Vauldrie? How do they... It's just an objectively bad deal. There's a ripe, easy option with the Anarchs. Give em some time and they could probably make a new sect or otherwise reform the anarchs to something of their liking.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Lasombra would never be able to survive in the Anarchs because, again, the Anarchs cannot be controlled and the Lasombra only want control.<br /> <br /> I don't understand what either side would benefit from.<br /> <br /> The Camarilla is the society of cut throat political intrigue and power building the Lasombra will thrive in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"h